{
  "_note": "Time Keeper paper theme. Verified from the logo (black script monogram on warm off-white #F0F0EC with a faint dial ring) and the brand template (black #111111 and white #FFFFFF headline boxes). No accent colour is invented: emphasis comes from black/white inversion and from the real photographs. Arabic headline face is Cairo ExtraBold as a stand-in for Bahij Helvetica Neue Bold, which is not available here.",
